' The Pause key in a v1.2 game (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30`):
' nothing. v1.2 never calls `PauseScene` (no `SetScene("PauseScene")` under
' `Scenes/`); the port's pause is the legacy game's only. With a pause the
' next key would only end it and the second save would not be taken; here
' both saves are taken (two `saved` lines) and no `paused` line is logged.
' In a legacy game (`legacy`) the same steps pause: one `paused` line, one save.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 10
save
pause                    ' the Pause key
wait 30
save                     ' taken: nothing was paused
quit
